  "id": "ssc-higher-math-paper-set-16-q14",
  "subject": "higher-math",
  "chapter": "ssc-higher-math-paper-set-16",
  "text": "যদি $\tan A=\frac34$ এবং $\tan B=\frac12$ হয়, তবে $\tan(A+B)$ কত?",
  "options": [
